{"id":43938,"date":"2026-09-23T14:53:34","date_gmt":"2026-09-23T18:53:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/upwithwomenstg.wpengine.com\/?p=43938"},"modified":"2026-09-24T11:16:00","modified_gmt":"2026-09-24T15:16:00","slug":"fast-company-100-best-workplaces-for-innovators-2026","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/fast-company-100-best-workplaces-for-innovators-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Up With Women\/Exponenti\u2019elles named one of Fast Company\u2019s 100 Best Workplaces for Innovators 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3fb47b81da5687edeeb2b45ecd1690ed\">We\u2019re proud to share that <strong>Up With Women\/Exponenti\u2019elles (UWW\/EXP)<\/strong> has been named one of <strong>Fast Company\u2019s 100 Best Workplaces for Innovators for 2026<\/strong>, joining a global roster of organizations recognized for fostering a culture of innovation at all levels. At UWW\/EXP, that culture empowers our employees to turn bold ideas into meaningful impact.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2a989a0a86f1ebcfe3645d67038909eb\"><strong>\u201cThis recognition belongs to the extraordinary community behind this work: our clients, volunteer coaches, partners, donors, and supporters,\u201d said Lia Grimanis, Founder and CEO of Up With Women\/Exponenti\u2019elles. \u201cThis honour elevates Canadian innovation on the global stage and advances the conversation around economic barriers faced by women and gender-diverse people. When we change how we approach a problem\u2014and who gets to be part of creating the solution\u2014we open the door to new possibilities. That\u2019s where true innovation happens.\u201d<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6281e4be90277ba1ce41a2f83754a529\">The awards have previously recognized global innovators such as <strong>Google, Siemens and L\u2019Or\u00e9al<\/strong>, underscoring the significance of our recognition as a growing Canadian charity bringing innovation to the complex challenge of gendered poverty. We were also named one of Fast Company\u2019s <strong>Small but Mighty Companies<\/strong>, honouring organizations with fewer than 100 employees that have cultivated workplaces where innovation can thrive. Together, these dual recognitions shine an international spotlight on our work helping women and gender-diverse people overcome barriers to economic opportunity through an innovative, community-based model.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-624c88ebdf530229a617e9cea8cc33e0\">We joined fellow honourees at the <strong>Fast Company Innovation Festival in New York City on September 16<\/strong>, where the 2026 Best Workplaces for Innovators were recognized. It was an opportunity to celebrate this milestone\u2014and the people and community who have helped make it possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background has-background has-grey-200-background-color\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"924\" height=\"924\" data-id=\"43957\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/5edcdf86-2af6-4d3f-a604-8d0559050876-edited.jpg\" alt=\"UWW\/EXP team members at the Fast Company Innovation Festival in New York City, September 2026.\" class=\"wp-image-43957\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1\" srcset=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/5edcdf86-2af6-4d3f-a604-8d0559050876-edited.jpg 924w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/5edcdf86-2af6-4d3f-a604-8d0559050876-edited-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/5edcdf86-2af6-4d3f-a604-8d0559050876-edited-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/5edcdf86-2af6-4d3f-a604-8d0559050876-edited-768x768.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 924px) 100vw, 924px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1007\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"43953\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6439-1007x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Up With Women\/Exponenti'elles featured in Fast Company magazine.\" class=\"wp-image-43953\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1\" srcset=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6439-1007x1024.jpg 1007w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6439-295x300.jpg 295w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6439-768x781.jpg 768w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6439-1511x1536.jpg 1511w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6439-2014x2048.jpg 2014w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1007px) 100vw, 1007px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"43959\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6422-1-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Up With Women\/Exponenti'elles featured in Fast Company magazine\" class=\"wp-image-43959\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1\" srcset=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6422-1-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6422-1-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6422-1-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6422-1-1536x2048.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/IMG_6422-1-scaled.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-custom-black-color\">Celebrating UWW\/EXP\u2019s recognition as one of Fast Company\u2019s 100 Best Workplaces for Innovators 2026, from the Innovation Festival in New York City to our feature in the magazine.<\/mark><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-heading-section-title\">Putting people at the centre<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6c1a0eeb521331b96a3948f348239aa2\">Founded in 2009, UWW\/EXP was born from Lia Grimanis\u2019 lived experience of violence and homelessness and her determination to help women and gender-diverse people facing similar barriers find pathways to meaningful employment and financial stability. Today, we have mobilized a national community of nearly <strong>500 volunteer professional coaches<\/strong> to support our clients.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8b0c1e51ece51a6fdce9413654469764\">Our strengths-based coaching model is grounded in a simple premise: <strong>clients are the experts in their own lives.<\/strong> They define their own goals, supported by coaches who help them build confidence and take steps to achieve them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-fca114ada321493b20a73438b0cc38b3\">Our model is delivering measurable results. An analysis of our 2025 clients, comparing outcomes from intake to graduation, found that:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6764b7c57dbeadd2a824ca0e3dc81e3b\"><strong>Annual client income increased by an average of 157 per cent.<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-db137ca1182c639f5fdcef93436e7949\"><strong>Reliance on social assistance decreased by 38 per cent, while full-time employment increased by 180 per cent.<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-792edd988fb4a6c910a86531f5a7800b\"><strong>More than 90 per cent of clients reported greater confidence and progress toward their goals.<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a43e36a7ae36de124cf0ca53a0b19f75\">Together, these outcomes affirm the value of community-driven innovation that puts people at the centre of addressing real-world challenges.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-heading-section-title\">Innovation is a shared responsibility<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-618607a7bb7fd12f8968abde35364c7e\">Our commitment to lived experience is reflected in our leadership. Our staff and Board include former clients and individuals with firsthand experience of the barriers we work to address, ensuring that lived expertise informs our organizational strategy, program design and decision-making.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-e5f2128b07d85586e32fb41e2e84e6ed\">At UWW\/EXP, innovation is a shared responsibility. People at all levels are empowered to identify challenges, improve processes and design solutions informed by the lived experiences and realities of the clients we serve.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"is-style-important has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-d946f88534659727d6a3760d2b1a8a77\"><strong>\u201cGendered poverty is one of Canada\u2019s most persistent challenges, but it is also an opportunity for innovation,\u201d said Grimanis. \u201cAddressing it calls for solutions that are community-led and grounded in the perspectives of those closest to the issues. We\u2019re honoured that Fast Company has recognized a model built on that belief.\u201d<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-b6e7eb8dde024cbee36b768257b1b826\">This recognition is a milestone for our organization, but it also belongs to the extraordinary community behind this work: our clients, volunteer coaches, partners, donors, supporters and team.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-d291fcbabb4217468664f39b6fcb894a\"><strong>We\u2019re grateful to everyone who continues to challenge us, collaborate with us and help turn new ideas into meaningful impact.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.fastcompany.com\/best-workplaces-for-innovators\/list\"><strong>Read the Fast Company Best Workplaces for Innovators list \u2192<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},